# Working notes. Kept on disk and in the Obsidian vault, deliberately out of the
# public repo — they are the workshop rather than the work. Note that removing
# them changes what the repo *reads* like, not what it discloses: tracks.js states
# every unlock condition in plain code and signals.js documents every debug
# parameter, so the album's mechanics are legible from the source either way.
